```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([API Request: POST /detect-conflicts]) --> Input[Input: session_ids<br/>session-A, session-B, session-C]

    Input --> QuerySessions[Query Session Details<br/>SELECT * FROM sessions<br/>WHERE id IN ...]

    QuerySessions --> Sessions[3 Sessions Retrieved<br/>- Pricing Strategy'Product Team<br/>- Marketing Plan'Marketing Team<br/>- Feature Roadmap'Engineering Team]

    Sessions --> Temporal[🕒 Temporal Conflict Detection<br/>Check for overlapping timelines<br/>+ shared stakeholders]
    Sessions --> Resource[👥 Resource Conflict Detection<br/>Count active sessions per stakeholder]
    Sessions --> Dependency[🔗 Dependency Conflict Detection<br/>Check for circular dependencies]
    Sessions --> Scope[📋 Scope Conflict Detection<br/>TF-IDF similarity analysis]

    Temporal --> TResult{Conflicts<br/>Found?}
    Resource --> RResult{Conflicts<br/>Found?}
    Dependency --> DResult{Conflicts<br/>Found?}
    Scope --> SResult{Conflicts<br/>Found?}

    TResult -->|Yes| TC[❌ TEMPORAL CONFLICT<br/>Severity: Medium<br/>Pricing + Marketing overlap 8 days<br/>Shared: alice@example.com]
    TResult -->|No| TSkip[✅ No temporal conflicts]

    RResult -->|Yes| RC[❌ RESOURCE CONFLICT<br/>Severity: High<br/>alice@example.com in 3 simultaneous decisions<br/>Overloaded: >5 sessions]
    RResult -->|No| RSkip[✅ No resource conflicts]

    DResult -->|Yes| DC[❌ DEPENDENCY CONFLICT<br/>Severity: High<br/>Circular dependency detected:<br/>A → B → C → A]
    DResult -->|No| DSkip[✅ No dependency conflicts]

    SResult -->|Yes| SC[❌ SCOPE CONFLICT<br/>Severity: Low<br/>Pricing + Marketing<br/>Similarity: 0.75 overlapping keywords]
    SResult -->|No| SSkip[✅ No scope conflicts]

    TC --> Suggestions
    RC --> Suggestions
    DC --> Suggestions
    SC --> Suggestions

    TSkip --> Combine
    RSkip --> Combine
    DSkip --> Combine
    SSkip --> Combine

    Suggestions[Generate Resolution Suggestions<br/>- Temporal: Stagger timelines by 2 weeks<br/>- Resource: Delegate to alternate stakeholders<br/>- Dependency: Break circular dep at weakest link<br/>- Scope: Merge related decisions]

    Suggestions --> CEE[Call CEE Service<br/>Generate coordination recommendations<br/>based on detected conflicts]

    CEE --> Combine[Combine Conflict Results]

    Combine --> Cache[Cache Results<br/>TTL: 5 minutes]

    Cache --> Return([Return ConflictDetection<br/>total_conflicts: 3<br/>severity breakdown])

